        "headline": "NTSB公布11月1日佛羅里達州Learjet 60墜機殘骸回收進度 調查原因仍未明",
        "summary": "美國國家運輸安全委員會（NTSB）於11月8日更新指出，11月1日在佛羅里達州棕櫚灘郡（Palm Beach County）墜毀的Learjet 60，已有部分殘骸送往華盛頓實驗室；尋獲部件包括兩側機翼及兩具引擎的組件、駕駛艙和尾翼等。機上9人全數罹難；NTSB正調查天氣狀況及空中解體證據，事故原因尚未確認，調查仍在進行。",
        "headline_en": "NTSB reports Learjet 60 wreckage recovery progress after Nov. 1 Florida crash, cause remains unknown",
        "summary_en": "The National Transportation Safety Board (NTSB) said on Nov. 8 that some wreckage from the Learjet 60 that crashed in Palm Beach County, Florida, on Nov. 1 had been sent to its laboratories in Washington. Recovered components include parts from both wings and both engines, the flight deck, vertical stabilizer, left elevator, aileron sections and flap-track assemblies. All nine people aboard were killed. The NTSB is investigating weather conditions and evidence of an in-flight breakup; the cause remains unconfirmed and the investigation is ongoing.",
