        "summary": "上週北大西洋強勁噴射氣流期間，多架跨大西洋航班據報出現超速示警。英國航空BA252波音777-200ER於3萬8千呎巡航時，一度超出適用操作速限約7至10節；機組爬升後平安降落希斯洛，無人受傷或航機受損。噴射氣流與此次示警之間的確切氣動關聯尚未確立。",
        "headline_en": "British Airways BA252 Boeing 777-200ER briefly exceeds operating speed limit, lands safely at Heathrow",
        "summary_en": "Several transatlantic flights reportedly experienced overspeed alerts during unusually strong jet-stream conditions over the North Atlantic last week. British Airways flight BA252, a Boeing 777-200ER, briefly exceeded its applicable operating speed limit by about 7–10 knots while cruising at 38,000 feet. The crew climbed to a higher altitude and landed safely at Heathrow; no injuries or aircraft damage were reported. The precise aerodynamic relationship between the jet stream and the alert has not been established.",
